  "_comment": [
    "Deep vertebrate backbone. None of the downloaded clade chronograms date these",
    "splits, so the ages here are hand-entered from the literature and each node",
    "carries its source. Ages are in Ma before present.",
    "",
    "Edit this file to change the backbone. build_payload.py reads it directly and",
    "no code needs touching. Node ids are referenced by fossils.json, grades.json",
    "and alternatives.json, so renaming an id means updating those too."
